cial Services Practice that provides comprehensive solutions designed to shape compelling corporate narratives, elevate brand visibility, drive capital formation and support sales growth.\
\
Our Financial Services Practice is led by two former senior producers from CNBC, one of whom was the co-founder of Fast Money. This broadcast pedigree informs our unmatched media acumen\'97KCSA secures an average of 3\'964 national broadcast placements per week, delivering impactful visibility where it matters most.\
\
We partner with innovative and established brands across the financial ecosystem. Notable client engagements, both past and present, include:\
ACG, FalconX, Flushing Financial, Klarna, Kyriba, LifeYield, Marcus &amp; Millichap, Merrill DataSite, Motley Fool Asset Management, Palmer Square Capital Management, Paymentus, R360, Strategic Asset Management (SAM), Tiger 21, Wexford Capital, and WisdomTree.\
\
Most recently, KCSA successfully supported Palmer Square Capital Management\'97a $35+ billion credit-focused alternative asset manager\'97in the launch of a pioneering European CLO ETF, showcasing our ability to navigate complex capital markets initiatives and deliver results across borders.\
