pany Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>InvestmentNews is evolving to become the definitive resource for independent-minded financial advisors as the wealth management industry rapidly shifts toward advisor independence. With RIAs gaining market share and more advisors seeking autonomy, InvestmentNews delivers proactive, real-time coverage through its website, newsletters, breaking news, and social media\'97helping advisors stay ahead with essential insights and analysis.\
\
The publication\'92s expert editorial team focuses on the independent broker-dealer and RIA ecosystems, offering deep industry knowledge across core areas: industry insights, regulation and compliance, wealth technology, practice management, retirement planning, and investing. InvestmentNews connects its highly engaged audience to thought leaders and decision-makers, providing both macro and micro perspectives through reporting, commentary, profiles, and events.\
\
Over half of InvestmentNews\'92 audience operates within the independent advisory ecosystem, with 52% directly influencing financial decisions, 77% involved in product and service selection, and over a third serving as final decision-makers in investment strategies. The readership includes both boutique and large-scale firms, many managing over $3 billion in assets.\
\
InvestmentNews also offers expanded partnership opportunities, including lead generation, sponsored content, audience extension, data research, and targeted advertising\'97delivering turnkey solutions for brands seeking to reach and engage the advisor community.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Canada</li><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Illinois</li><li>New Hampshire</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Media or Financial Influencer</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>251-1,000</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Digital Marketing</li><li>Financial Research and Analytics</li><li>Marketing and Communications Services</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</lab