\
We built Leveridge to fix that.\
\
We help advisors integrate real estate into the plan by reducing workload and compliance risks. Our planning-first lending support and AI-powered reports help you deliver clear, client-ready insights on buy/sell/refi/rent decisions.\
\
** Bottom line ** : We help you take the emotion out of your clients\'92 real estate decisions , and replace it with data they trust.\
\
Use us to:\
\
-- Analyze rental properties with clean, shareable reports\
   Help clients make informed hold vs. sell decisions without spreadsheets, guesswork, or manual inputs.\
\
-- Show clients what they\'92d net \'97 and what to do next\
   DSTs, 1031 exchanges, Roth conversions, alternative investments \'97 you can\'92t recommend next steps until you know the numbers.\
\
-- Preserve liquidity and keep portfolios intact\
   Guide clients on down payment sizing, equity access, and smart leverage \'97 so they don\'92t liquidate accounts just to close.\
\
-- Deliver full-service lending without losing control\
   We handle the execution \'97 purchases, refis, equity access \'97 in sync with your plan and under your direction.\
\
-- Make real estate a proactive part of the plan\
   Property decisions impact taxes, cash flow, and long-term flexibility. You should be the one leading that conversation.\
\
We work behind the scenes. You stay the lead. Your client sees smart strategy \'97 not sales.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>California</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Professional Services Firm</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>10 or fewer</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_video_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_showParticipants"><button type="button" title="Hide 2 Participant" class="ptButton ptButton--primary">Hide 2 Participant</button></div></div><div class="selectable