ataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Miller Global Investments, L.L.C. is an independent, registered investment advisory firm* located in Dallas, Texas. We specialize in investment management for private investors such as individuals, families, trusts, partnerships, and private companies. We invest in growth, income, and alternative assets with an emphasis on absolute returns. \
\
Our six investment strategies:\
\
Cash -- Treasurys, money market funds, and ultra short term corporates; actively manage for returns.\
\
Fixed Income -- taxable and tax-exempt bonds including government, corporate, agency, municipal, and mortgage-backed securities; we focus on credit quality and duration to manage risk.\
\
Equity Income-U.S. -- U.S. stocks that pay high dividend yields including real estate investment trusts, business development companies, preferred, utility, infrastructure, and other high dividend paying common stocks; we focus on the financial and operational characteristics, sustainability of the dividend, and valuation.\
\
Equity Growth-U.S. -- stocks of growing U.S. companies; we focus on the financial and operational characteristics and valuation.\
\
Equity International -- stocks of growing international companies in both the developed and emerging markets; we focus on the financial and operational characteristics and valuation.\
\
Alternative -- absolute return oriented and commodity investments that have shown low historical correlation to stocks or bonds.\
\
We also provide financial planning and advise our clients on a variety of financial matters.\
\
Our philosophy is to preserve and grow our investor\'92s capital with superior personal service and the utmost standards of integrity. We construct diversified investment portfolios to match our investor\'92s goals and risk tolerance. Our mission is to preserve and grow the wealth of our investors over the long-term by offering thoughtful investment strategies along with superior personalized service.\
\
*Registration does not imply a certain level of skill or training.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Texas</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Advisory Firm</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>Registered Investment Advisor (RIA)</abbr></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>10 or fewer</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Alternative Investing</li><li>Commodities</li><li>Fixed Income</li><li>Public Equities - International</li><li>Public Equities - U.S.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Client Survey/Feedback</li><li>Commodities</li><li>Crypto/digital assets</li><li>Digital Marketing</l