v></div><div class="selectable_card_participantCard_dataWrapper"><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Pave is a wealthtech startup that uses forms of AI such as machine learning and predictive analytics to support advisers in building and managing client portfolios.  The Software as a Service (SaaS) platform uses models that have a track record dating back to 2010, but recently have been repurposed into a software allowing advisers to create account by account customization/ personalization. The account level customization includes passive or active management, tax optimization, values based screens, concentrated position optimization, sector/industry/position exclusions, factor tilts and more.\
\
Our objective is to empower advisors or portfolio managers to focus on more productive tasks like relationship management, financial planning, business development, etc. Our platform saves time by automating many investment management tasks such as rebalancing, tax loss harvesting, tactical adjustments, and security selection. We enhance profitability by improving customization and improving client outcomes - thus driving improved client retention and referrals. Our innovative cost structure generally saves money by reducing/eliminating many third party fees.\
\
