1987.  True to its roots, PCM remains an employee owned and operated Firm with a strong reputation as an excellent boutique public market investor.  PCM\'92s seasoned research team is highly disciplined, conducting exhaustive proprietary research to independently evaluate businesses, their intrinsic value, and their leadership teams.  We focus on identifying deeply discounted companies, most frequently in the sub-$2b in market cap space. The lack of Wall Street focus on the types of businesses in which we invest gives rise to information inefficiencies and institutional disinterest.   We look to exploit public market valuation disjunctions where our analytical perspective opens the door to better (and more deeply discounted) opportunities.  The quality of our research is well demonstrated by the outstanding long-term track records of our PCM Value Fund (VFPIX) and Value Focus (SMA) strategy.  In keeping with our high conviction, bottom-up research focus, both VFPIX and our Value Focus strategy maintain concentrated portfolios of about 25 - 30 names.  This means that even when markets are expensive (as we think they are in some segments today) we can still find value.  It also means that individual investments can be impactful on portfolio returns.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Florida</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Fund Services Firm (Distribution, Admi