\
We've built Sophie, an AI assistant that helps financial advisors truly understand their clients as individuals. Sophie pays attention to how each person talks about money, what worries them, and what they really want to achieve. She builds a complete picture of each person's unique relationship with money\'97like a financial fingerprint that gets more accurate over time.\
\
But Sophie goes beyond just understanding\'97she spots opportunities that others miss.When a client mentions their child starting college or expresses concern about market volatility, Sophie alerts the advisor: "This is the perfect time to discuss education savings" or "Your client needs reassurance about their retirement plan." These insights become clear next steps that advisors can act on immediately.\
\
The result? Real financial improvements for clients.They might save more money, reach their goals faster, pay less in taxes, or optimize their income\'97all because their advisor knew exactly when and how to help. This creates stronger trust and better relationships.\
