\
Clients benefit from a superior client experience in terms of 1) technology, 2) service enhancement that boosts our advisory team's value-add to client, and 3) our leverage to negotiate institutional pricing from mutual fund companies, to replicate beta and factor based strategies like ETFs, index funds, private credit and private equity pools, etc in-house, saving Clients significant BPS.\
\
Advisors benefit from true business partnership in our co-op style model where advisors own and run the firm together with a head office executive and management team approaching 100 people, that will never serve more than 99 Partner teams ever. This is a servant leadership culture where our role is to serve our Partners, taking work off your desk, augmenting your team fractionally with A-players who are specialists in their areas of expertise. Our in house marketing agency has helped our Partners grow (on average) at 4-6x the industry average for organic growth, and our M&amp;A team supports our partners with valuation, legal structure, and financing to help boost growth through creative deal making.\
\
Partners ultimately participate in 90% of the profits of the firm, owning the vast majority of equity - not just in their own book of business, but also in the Q Wealth platform, the tech IP we develop together, and the asset management platform.\
\
To join, prospective Partners must receive endorsements from 5 existing Platform Partners, and receive endorsement from the Executive team. Min revenue to join in 2025 is 2.5 Million CAD (goes to 3 Million in 2026).</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Canada</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Advisory Firm</li><li>Investment Management</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>Other</abbr></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>51-250</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>"All-in-One" Advisor Platform</li><li>Advice Engagement</li><li>Advisory Fee Billing</li><li>Behavioral Assessments</li><li>Business Intelligence/Metrics</li><li>CRM &amp; CRM Overlay</li><li>Compliance</li><li class="moreButton"><span class="tooltipIconWrapper"><span>+ 16 More</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullW