p: 3;"><span><abbr>S&amp;P Dow Jones Indices (S&amp;P DJI) is a leading provider of financial market indices, renowned for its comprehensive and innovative index solutions. A subsidiary of S&amp;P Global, S&amp;P DJI was formed through the merger of S&amp;P Indices and Dow Jones Indexes, which brought together two of the most respected names in the industry. The company is headquartered in New York City and operates globally, serving a diverse range of clients including institutional investors, asset managers, and financial advisors.\
\
S&amp;P DJI is best known for its flagship indices, including the S&amp;P 500, which tracks the performance of 500 of the largest publicly traded companies in the United States, and the Dow Jones Industrial Average (DJIA), one of the oldest and most widely recognized stock market indices in the world. These indices serve as benchmarks for the performance of the U.S. equity markets and are integral to a variety of financial products, including mutual funds, exchange-traded funds (ETFs), and derivatives.\
\
The company's indices cover a broad spectrum of asset classes, sectors, and regions, allowing investors to gain insights into global market trends. S&amp;P DJI offers a wide range of indices, including those focused on equities, fixed income, commodities, and real estate. The indices are designed to be transparent, rules-based, and reflective of the underlying markets they represent, ensuring that they meet the needs of investors seeking reliable performance metrics.\
