We offer the largest faith-based fund in the country. Let us share how to replicate the success of this Islamic fund with Muslims and non-Muslims alike\
Nick Kaiser founded Saturna Capital in 1989 with a distinct vision for its investors:&nbsp;preserve capital and provide value.\
Nick is fond of saying,&nbsp;\'93The money you don\'92t lose is the easiest money you can make.\'94&nbsp;Following this discipline, Saturna Capital aims to deliver true value to clients by offering conservative, ethical investment solutions that preserve capital while aligning with their values and long-term goals.\
As a family- and employee-owned firm, we are committed to offering exceptional service, transparency, and providing high-quality, faith-based, and sustainable financial products at a fair price.\
\
Preserve Capital\
Across all mutual funds and financial services products, Saturna's investment approach is guided by a few core principles that align with our mission of delivering value for your money. These include a commitment to:&nbsp;\
Conservative growth\
Minimizing loss while preserving capital\
Lower volatility\
Long-term buy and hold management\
Low expense ratios\
Sustainable investment practices\
These conservative investment principles would become the hallmark of Saturna\'92s investing style throughout its 35 years of business.\
\
Provide Value\
Since inception, Saturna has taken a wide-ranging view of the meaning of value.\
From practicing classic value investing, to offering value in the form of low expenses and affordable management, Saturna has always looked to provide its customers with a great product at a fair price. Additionally, Saturna has sought to create investment products that reflect the personal values and ethics of its customers.\
Saturna is proud to manage many of the world\'92s largest faith-based funds and some of the most unique sustainable investment opportunities.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>New York</li><li>Washington</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Investment Management</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>51-250</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Advisor Lead Gen</li><li>Fixed Income</li><li>General Asset Management</li><li>Mutual Funds</li><li>SMAs</li><li>Socially Responsible Investments</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Fixed Income</li><li>General Asset Management<