trategic partner that they trust to provide a high level of service and expertise for the life of our portfolios.\
\
We work on a transactional basis using trade-away or prime broker at every major custodian including Schwab, Fidelity, and more. \
\
We currently oversee and advise on over $4 Billion in fixed-income assets across ~150 advisor relationships, many of them using us as a fully outsourced fixed-income department.\
\
