ionals sourcing and managing investments in dedicated regions across the United States.\
\
Since its inception, Stockbridge has been investing in U.S. real estate on behalf of institutional clients through various investment vehicles. The firm invests across the risk spectrum and employs a variety of structures on behalf of both U.S. and foreign investors. Our investors include eight of the largest U.S. retirement plans and four of the world\'92s largest non-U.S. institutional investors.\
\
The firm\'92s thesis-driven approach allows us to capitalize on major consumer, economic, and demographic trends. Currently, we believe that a unique opportunity exists in the real estate asset class. The property market correction of 2023 and 2024 marks the fourth significant dislocation in the real estate asset class since 1970. Each prior instance\'97the early 1970s, the oversupply of the 1980s and early 1990s, and the Great Financial Crisis\'97provided compelling opportunities to invest.\
\
Stockbridge products are available through leading custodial platforms, including Charles Schwab, Fidelity (NTF), and Pershing. We have also partnered with iCapital's Marketplace platform and Subscribe.\
\
We invite you to join the discussion.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>California</li><li>Georgia</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Investment Management</li><li>Limited Partner (Institutional)</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>51-250</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Alternative Investing</li><li>General Asset Management</li><li>Real Estate</li><li>Real Estate Investment Trusts (REITs)</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Alternative Investing</li><li>General Asset Management</li><li>General Portfolio Management</li><li>Real Estate</li><li>Real Estate Inve