Monolith innovated Direct Pay Letter of Credit funding for life insurance, commonly known as bond financing in 2004. This structure was created to provide an institutional capital solution for funding life insurance in a manner eliminates the need for direct premium payments while reducing the counterparty and strategic risks inherent with traditional premium financing arrangements. \
