Vanguard was launched in 1975, but our heritage extends back to 1929 with the inception of Wellington Fund, one of the first balanced mutual funds and one of the longest-operating funds of any kind. Today we provide an extensive array of investment products, including a full range of low-cost ETFs and mutual funds designed to help financial advisors grow and preserve the wealth of their clients.\
Most investment firms are either publicly traded or privately owned. Vanguard is different: We're owned by the Vanguard funds, which are owned by our clients. Our unique structure, along with our commitment to provide outstanding performance and service at the lowest possible cost, helps financial advisors build their businesses, as well as enrich their client relationships.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Canada</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Investment Management</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>More than 1,000</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>"All-in-One" Advisor Platform</li><li>Client Data Gathering</li><li>Digital Marketing</li><li>Exchange-Traded Funds (ETFs)</li><li>Family Office Services</li><li>Financial Planning</li><li>Fixed Income</li><li class="moreButton"><span class="tooltipIconWrapper"><span>+ 6 More</span