\
At Winstone, we believe great financial advice goes beyond numbers. We take the time to understand what matters most to our clients: family, purpose, and freedom, and build customized plans that reflect their values and long-term goals. Whether it\'92s planning for retirement, managing an inheritance, preparing for a liquidity event, or ensuring a lasting legacy, we serve as a trusted guide at every step.\
\
As a hybrid RIA/BD, we offer objective advice while providing access to a broad range of tools, research, and investment solutions. Our approach blends sophisticated investment management with thoughtful financial planning, proactive tax strategies, and collaborative estate planning. We work closely with our clients\'92 attorneys, CPAs, and other professionals to ensure every piece of the financial puzzle fits together.\
\
Winstone Wealth Partners was built on a foundation of trust, transparency, and personalized service. Our team brings energy, authenticity, and deep expertise to every relationship. We believe in clear communication, strategic thinking, and doing the hard work behind the scenes so our clients can focus on living the life they\'92ve worked so hard to build.\
\
We empower people to find freedom. Whether it\'92s helping our clients enjoy the life they have worked hard for or supporting our employees in building fulfilling careers that lead to personal financial freedom and true work-life balance, we are committed to helping others grow with purpose.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Texas</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Advisory Firm</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>Independent Broker-Dealer (IBD)</abbr></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>10 or fewer</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Advisor Lead Gen</li><li>General Asset Management</li><li>Retirement Planning</li><li>SMAs</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Int