/path></svg><span>YouPotential</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_participantCard_dataWrapper"><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>ouPotential is a podcast that explores the psychology of human potential \'97 how money, meaning, and mindset intersect to shape the life we create. Hosted by Certified Financial Planner and positive psychology coach Shaun Maslyk, the show blends candid storytelling with science-backed insights to help listeners live with more intention.\
\
Through conversations with authors, researchers, athletes, and creators, YouPotential digs into seven pillars of a good life: meaning, vibrant health, connected relationships, growth, financial well-being, exploring possibilities, and inner well-being. The goal is simple: to move beyond quick fixes and surface-level success, and instead invite listeners to reflect, reimagine, and reconnect with what really matters.\
\
